    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 44 Woodbrook Park to the open market. A well cared for semi-detached home standing on a large site with front, side and rear gardens and garage.\r\n\r\nFull of natural light, south facing to rear and open aspect to front. Ample room to extend subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall with w.c., whb off. Lounge with tiled fireplace, Diningroom with patio doors to rear. The Kitchen has a range of wall and floor units and is plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. \r\n\r\nUpstairs are three Bedrooms, two to front, one with fitted wardrobe and one with tiled fireplace. Bedroom three to rear has a wall to wall fitted wardrobe. The Bathroom has shower, w.c., whb. Outside are spacious well-maintained gardens, ample parking and garage.\r\n\r\nThe property is wonderfully positioned beside a range of schools, bus routes, Rathfarnham shopping centre, Templeogue village etc. There are a number of sports facilities nearby, parks and the M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nCeiling coving and centre rose. Understairs storage. W.c, whb with medicine cupboard. Vanity mirror. Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nCeiling coving and centre rose. Tiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nDiningroom\r\nCeiling coving and centre rose. Service hatch to kitchen. Sliding patio door to rear.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nRange of wall and floor units. Sink unit. Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher. C.H. Boiler.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Front)\r\nFitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Front)\r\nTiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Rear)\r\nWall to wall fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nHot press. Pull down ladder.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nShower, w.c., whb. Fully tiled. Medicine cabinet.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront garden. Side vehicular access. Garage. Walled south facing rear garden. \r\nOuthouses. Tap. Power point. Lighting"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "GFCH\r\nSemi Detached \r\nDouble glazed\r\nSouth facing to rear\r\nAmple parking to front \r\nRoom to extend subject to p.p \r\nWalking distance to a host of schools\r\nBeside numerous recreational and shopping facilities\r\nConvenient location to fantastic transport links"
      },
